        "assertion": "Through resolveVerificationCommand and runFixedVerification with real child processes: a host tool whose '#!' line names another script runs, a tool using 'env -S' runs, an entry file replaced during the run fails the identity check, and a timeout removes every process of the run; seam: tests/pi-canary-verification-descriptor.test.ts (Spec SCN-5, D6, I3).",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v2\",\n  \"command\": {\n    \"executable\": \"bun\",\n    \"argv\": [\n      \"test\",\n      \"tests/pi-canary-verification-descriptor.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"cwd\": \".\",\n    \"timeout_ms\": 600000,\n    \"max_output_bytes\": 196608\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"prepare\": null,\n    \"writable_paths\": []\n  }\n}\n"
